**Properties:**

{% section class="api-ref-property-list" %}
  {% details %}
  {% summary %}
  **category**: {% mark %}required{% /mark %} [`HarmCategory`](/api-reference/generate-content#Resource:HarmCategory)

  The category for this setting.

